# reference: https://antidote.sh/#plugins-file
# Every plugin is pinned to a commit (pin: needs antidote 2.0+); `antidote update`
# skips pinned plugins. Bump them with scripts/bump-zsh-pins.sh.

# first: it runs compinit, and queues the compdef calls of the plugins below
